# ref-51f056e-world-neutral
# Five 1 m unit boxes stacked (1 m spacing, so the boxes touch) on a flat ground,
# 60 steps at fixed dt=1/60, 4 substeps, no wall clock.
# Reference: vanilla float box3d at upstream commit 51f056e.
# Fixed: fixed3d on this branch (b3GetWorldByteCount reports the world's bytes; the
#   counter refactor is simulation-neutral and must not move the simulation).
# Observable: the stack's contact count and the top box's resting height after 60 steps.
# Tolerance: top box resting height within 0.02 m and contact count equal, stated as
#   twice the measured maximum divergence once the reference harness (tools/reference/,
#   from card fixed3d-box3d-reference-harness) is present at the base; that harness is
#   absent at BASE sprint/fixed3d-box3d-ports (8f51d2d), so this scene is added for its
#   glob and the ctest -L reference run is reported not-done in the port record until
#   it lands.
# Fixed-point divergence (by design, CLAUDE.md c37cfe4 record): the engine is Q48.16
#   fixed point with the exact-SAT structure and no float SIMD hull core, so transform
#   traces are not bit-identical to float; the 5-box stack must still settle to the same
#   resting configuration within the stated tolerance.
scene ref-51f056e-world-neutral
mesh wave 40 40 cell 1.0 amplitude 0.0 rowHz 0.0 columnHz 0.0
body box half 0.5 position 0 0.5 0 density 1.0
body box half 0.5 position 0 1.5 0 density 1.0
body box half 0.5 position 0 2.5 0 density 1.0
body box half 0.5 position 0 3.5 0 density 1.0
body box half 0.5 position 0 4.5 0 density 1.0
steps 60 dt 1/60 substeps 4
expect contactCount >= 4
expect topBoxY > 3.0
